eibi-swl-dashboard (1.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix azmap-gtk launch: pass only the target position so azmap-gtk keeps
    the center from its own config instead of being overridden by the
    swl-sched QTH.
  * Launch azmap-gtk in its own session and reap it when it exits, so closed
    map instances no longer linger as zombie processes.
  * Report an azmap-gtk startup failure in the update log instead of
    discarding its stderr.
  * Correct GitHub URLs from mikewam to dielectric-coder, which also repairs
    the source URL used by the Arch PKGBUILD.

 -- Michel Lachaine <mike@mikelachaine.ca>  Wed, 05 Aug 2026 12:00:00 -0400

eibi-swl-dashboard (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

